+## Sprint Plan: Complete Agentic Safety, Multimodal Hardening, and Generative Evidence Campaign
+Goal: Raise conservative autonomy score to >= 82% and capability average to >= 88% by completing agentic safety hardening, multimodal operational hardening, and a 30-day generative long-shadow campaign.
+
+Duration: 8 weeks (target). Adjust per team velocity.
+
+Team:
+- ML Lead (owner: verifiers & planner tuning)
+- SRE/Infra (owner: ingestion, Triton, kernel tuning)
+- Security/Platform (owner: RBAC/IdP & wrapper audits)
+- Product/SME (owner: verifier signoff)
+
+Milestones:
+- Week 0: Mobilize, run baseline acceptance (existing workflows), generate initial autonomy report.
+- Week 1–2: Complete IdP->RBAC sync and ConfigMap, finalize wrapper generator, run wrapper_audit_runner, complete verified_k8s & storage adapters, fix gaps.
+- Week 3–4: Run long dry‑runs (2k iterations); iterate planner prompt & schema until hallucination < 0.1%. Produce dry‑run evidence artifacts and update autonomy_config.json.
+- Week 4–5: Ingest stress testing & tuning: run ingest_stress_runner (1k+ uploads), iterate chunk sizes/HPA; validate error rate < 2%.
+- Week 5: Kernel tuner runs on representative GPU nodes, validate and bake configmaps, run triton reload and validate inference.
+- Week 5–8: Start 30-day long-shadow campaign; aggregate daily reports; weekly SME reviews; after 30 days run SME signoff and record result.
+- Week 8: Run MTTR drill (ops/agent/run_mttr_drill.sh), finalize runbooks, and flip staged automation ramp from 1% → 5% as safety gate.
+
+Acceptance Criteria / Gates:
+- Agentic:
+  - All side-effecting tools have generated wrappers and pass wrapper_audit_runner (dry_run).
+  - Planner hallucination/schema-failure rate < 0.1% in long dry-runs.
+  - IdP->RBAC sync is operational with ConfigMap agent-rbac populated and validated.
+  - Transaction manager records all tx and rollback tested in MTTR drill (critical rollback < 15 mins).
+- Multimodal:
+  - Ingest resumable error rate < 2% at target throughput in stress tests.
+  - Kernel tuner results validated on representative GPUs and applied via ConfigMap.
+  - Model repo packaging -> upload -> triton reload validated via model_repo_watcher and validate_and_test_model.
+- Generative:
+  - 30+ day long-shadow campaign completed with divergence and verifier metrics within thresholds.
+  - SME signoff recorded via services/factuality/sme_signoff.py
+
+Risks & Mitigations:
+- Risk: Planner hallucination persists. Mitigation: stricter prompt + parsing + human-in-loop for medium/high risk.
+- Risk: Ingest failures under load. Mitigation: throttling, exponential backoff, HPA tuning.
+- Risk: Kernel tuner causing regressions. Mitigation: A/B rollout of tuned configs, validate on representative nodes only.
+
+Deliverables:
+- Wrapper audit report (S3) and fixes committed.
+- Long dry-run report (S3) and autonomy recalculation.
+- Ingest stress report (S3) and tuned HPA settings.
+- Kernel tuner configmap & triton reload evidence.
+- 30-day shadow reports and SME signoff artifact.
+- Updated autonomy_config.json and final autonomy report.
+
